+## Privacy and security
+
+Reading is anonymous. Bookmarks use an explicit-save-only, 30-minute temporary
+server session, with view/delete controls at `/devtools-times/legal/privacy`.
+Account collection is paused pending authentication-provider review. Third-party
+analytics, advertising SDK queues, fonts and remotely hosted images are removed.
+
+Run `pnpm test:privacy` for automated production HTTP/API and resource checks,
+and `pnpm audit:dependencies` for production dependency advisories.
+See [the data inventory, third-party review gate and deployment requirements](docs/PRIVACY.md).
